{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1225115-mrgone-changeling-2e-character-sheet-question","id":1225115,"title":"Mrgone Changeling 2E Character Sheet Question","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-06-05T16:30:16-07:00","id":1225115,"title":"Mrgone Changeling 2E Character Sheet Question","content":"<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Hello all, so I just have a -possibly quite stupid- question. How does the health track work on CtL 2E character sheets (and really all 2E character sheets) by Mrgone? (For example, these: </span></span><a href=\"https://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/ctl2nded.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">https://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/ctl2nded.html</span></span></a><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Am I missing something? How does one add the / and X? I have used Adobe Reader and Foxit Reader and neither allow me to edit the second row of boxes. Thank you for any help/ answers you can provide and I am really sorry if I am just being an idiot and missed something obvious. </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Also, either way, thank you Mrgone for putting these sheets out in the first place, they are a great help.</span></span><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13217-ember16","name":"Ember16","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13217_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-07T11:52:51-07:00","id":1225644,"title":"","content":"I thought you could just click them multiple times (same box) and it changes it if it is the form editable version no?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Kinda I want to&quot; - Trent Reznor<br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://scontent.ftpa1-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t1.0-9/27973518_2040009129348529_5319855605701568493_n.jpg?oh=9c85c5c9d4a0769a1249ea2f3e62ca43&amp;oe=5B002AA5\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12143-eldritchminister","name":"EldritchMinister","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12143_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-08T08:36:05-07:00","id":1225881,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>EldritchMinister</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1225115-mrgone-changeling-2e-character-sheet-question?p=1225644#post1225644\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I thought you could just click them multiple times (same box) and it changes it if it is the form editable version no?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Doing so for me just highlights the whole lower row of boxes blue. The only thing I can edit is the upper row on the health track, which fills the squares completely.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13217-ember16","name":"Ember16","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13217_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-02T10:49:22-07:00","id":1231872,"title":"","content":"Ah I see what you're saying.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Kinda I want to&quot; - Trent Reznor<br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://scontent.ftpa1-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t1.0-9/27973518_2040009129348529_5319855605701568493_n.jpg?oh=9c85c5c9d4a0769a1249ea2f3e62ca43&amp;oe=5B002AA5\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12143-eldritchminister","name":"EldritchMinister","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12143_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-02T14:56:41-07:00","id":1231949,"title":"","content":"These aren't editable health sheets. Most of his sheets aren't - though some of them are.<br /> <br /> You can fix this yourself in PDF editing software by creating small text-entry form fields aligned with each of the boxes, where you can manually enter / X *. That's what I've done for my groups' games, though we tend to use B/L/A instead for better clarity.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-18T11:50:08-07:00","id":1247448,"title":"","content":"I Hope this doesn't count as thread necro but the Fae-Touched characters no longer have a Seeming in 2nd. Ed so Mr. Gone's sheet might need to be updated. Additionally, in it's place I bet the Promise could go there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-19T15:38:08-07:00","id":1247828,"title":"","content":"Oh! I'm so sorry I missed this before....<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ember16</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1225115-mrgone-changeling-2e-character-sheet-question#post1225115\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Hello all, so I just have a -possibly quite stupid- question. How does the health track work on CtL 2E character sheets (and really all 2E character sheets) by Mrgone? (For example, these: </span></span><a href=\"https://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/ctl2nded.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">https://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/ctl2nded.html</span></span></a><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Am I missing something? How does one add the / and X? I have used Adobe Reader and Foxit Reader and neither allow me to edit the second row of boxes. Thank you for any help/ answers you can provide and I am really sorry if I am just being an idiot and missed something obvious. </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Also, either way, thank you Mrgone for putting these sheets out in the first place, they are a great help.</span></span><br /></div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lnodiv</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1225115-mrgone-changeling-2e-character-sheet-question?p=1231949#post1231949\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">These aren't editable health sheets. Most of his sheets aren't - though some of them are.<br /> <br /> You can fix this yourself in PDF editing software by creating small text-entry form fields aligned with each of the boxes, where you can manually enter / X *. That's what I've done for my groups' games, though we tend to use B/L/A instead for better clarity.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yea.....sadly those aren't interactive. When I first started doing the NWoD sheets, with the way the health worked and how you had to record it(by putting numbers under the boxes, and then filling in the boxes with different symbols), I couldn't think of a good way to do it. And before I knew it, I had a TON of NWoD sheets....so I just left them as blank.<br /> <br /> Best I could do is potentially make tiny text boxes over the boxes(as <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar3570_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"3570\" data-vbnamecard=\"3570\">lnodiv</a> mentioned), and you could type in the needed symbol. But not sure I want to go back and change all the NWoD sheets for that. Plus, adding the spots for the numbers under it might not work as well either, as lining them up could be difficult...<br /> <br /> Anyway, I'm so sorry about that.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>EldritchMinister</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1225115-mrgone-changeling-2e-character-sheet-question?p=1225644#post1225644\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I thought you could just click them multiple times (same box) and it changes it if it is the form editable version no?</div> </div> </div> </div>Sadly no. In Acrobat the form fields are a set symbol, and then on or off. If there is a way to do multiple symbols with multiple clicks I've yet to find it... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>xiongrey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1225115-mrgone-changeling-2e-character-sheet-question?p=1247448#post1247448\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I Hope this doesn't count as thread necro but the Fae-Touched characters no longer have a Seeming in 2nd. Ed so Mr. Gone's sheet might need to be updated. Additionally, in it's place I bet the Promise could go there.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, thanks for letting me know. I updated the sheet and added Promise in place of seeming. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-23T06:05:45-07:00","id":1248847,"title":"","content":"Congrats for your work Mr. Gone!<br /> Just a little question for the CtL sheet: the small lines at the bottom say that you can spend 5 in contracts. Shouldn't that be 6? 4 contracts from Common Regalia, Courts or Goblin contracts plus 2 contracts from Royal Contracts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24237-pluvinarch","name":"Pluvinarch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24237_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-26T17:15:26-07:00","id":1249038,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pluvinarch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1225115-mrgone-changeling-2e-character-sheet-question?p=1248847#post1248847\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Congrats for your work Mr. Gone!</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks! I appreciate it!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Or