ss=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-26T05:49:23-07:00","id":1257345,"title":"","content":"Looks fantastic! What software do you edit the PDF's in? I may have to copy the new health formatting to some other sheets for my games.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Find my Homebrew so far here: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/18X_mkFwDcM0sSN9R2GoQ72Q5FqW1deFgEM3HIGneABQ/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...it?usp=sharing</a><br /> So far its Demon Merits, Vampire 1e to 2e ports and a Knowledge collection mechanic for the Ordo Dracul!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24597-lordofiron","name":"LordofIron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24597_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-30T07:12:58-07:00","id":1258198,"title":"","content":"Just one doubt: why are there two empty Clarity boxes on the left of the Clarity 1 to 11 boxes. I suppose 1 to 10 Clarity boxes is for the Wits + Composure stats (max 10) and the eleventh is in case the character finds an Icon left behind. But the two leftmost boxes without numbers?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24237-pluvinarch","name":"Pluvinarch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24237_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-30T08:53:26-07:00","id":1258213,"title":"","content":"I believe it's because Touchstones aren't written next to the first Clarity box. Count boxes from the left equal to the character's Composure+1 and that's the box the first Touchstone is attached to. Additional Touchstones are written to the right.<br /> Unfortunately someone counted wrong because the first Touchstone can be put at the second box rather than the third. Unless the whole thing was changed after the Kickstarter preview was released and Mr Gone knows something we others don't.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-05T04:32:50-07:00","id":1259046,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordofIron</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1225115-mrgone-changeling-2e-character-sheet-question?p=1257345#post1257345\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Looks fantastic! What software do you edit the PDF's in? I may have to copy the new health formatting to some other sheets for my games.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you! Glad you liked it.<br /> <br /> And I have an old version of Adobe Acrobat that I use to make all my character sheets, version 5. I have a copy of the newest version, and I use it to make the forms savable in Reader. But yea, I still use that old version to make and edit all my sheets. It can be a pain sometimes, but the end result is usually always good. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pluvinarch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1225115-mrgone-changeling-2e-character-sheet-question?p=1258198#post1258198\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just one doubt: why are there two empty Clarity boxes on the left of the Clarity 1 to 11 boxes. I suppose 1 to 10 Clarity boxes is for the Wits + Composure stats (max 10) and the eleventh is in case the character finds an Icon left behind. But the two leftmost boxes without numbers?</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1225115-mrgone-changeling-2e-character-sheet-question?p=1258213#post1258213\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I believe it's because Touchstones aren't written next to the first Clarity box. Count boxes from the left equal to the character's Composure+1 and that's the box the first Touchstone is attached to. Additional Touchstones are written to the right.<br /> Unfortunately someone counted wrong because the first Touchstone can be put at the second box rather than the third. Unless the whole thing was changed after the Kickstarter preview was released and Mr Gone knows something we others don't.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sorry about that. I just had a request from OP to correct that, and the updated sheet has been uploaded. We just mis-counted., so we removed one of the dots and boxes and then moved the numbers under the second box.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-05T09:25:47-08:00","id":1528030,"title":"","content":"Hi everyone! I wanted to necro this thread to let you know that I now Seeming and Court branded character sheets for Changeling the Lost 2nd Edition!<br /> <br /> <br /> I hope you like how they turned out!<br /> <br /> <br /> You can download the new sheets in the CtL section of my site here: <a href=\"https://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/cofd.html#ctl\" target=\"_blank\">https://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/cofd.html#ctl</a><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site